        "original_id": "d8537576-442f-589b-86c1-4674907c140d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Gray Television, Entravision Communications Corporation\n- TV Stations: KSCW-DT, KWCH-DT, KDCU-DT\n- Networks: CBS, Univision\n- Places: Wichita, Kansas, United States, Hutchinson\n- Concepts: duopoly, joint sales agreement\n\nFacts:\n- KWCH-DT is a CBS-affiliated television station serving Wichita, Kansas, United States, and it is licensed to Hutchinson.\n- KWCH-DT broadcasts on virtual channel 12 and UHF digital channel 19.\n- Gray Television owns KSCW-DT as part of a duopoly with CBS affiliate KWCH-DT.\n- Gray Television also operates Univision affiliate KDCU-DT on channel 31 under a joint sales agreement with its owner, Entravision Communications Corporation.",
